; a bed of pure sound for scene_sfx_only: the garden at night with no music in it. No
; harmony, no beat: wind swelling and falling away (noise, the left chip), a near cricket
; (tone and noise, right) and a far one (tone only, left, softer), on loops of different
; lengths so they drift. Effects take these voices when they need them.
(pattern wind
    "m2 n26 l20 v3 c4 v4 c4 n24 v5 c4 v6 c4 n22 v7 c4 v6 c4 n24 v5 c4 v4 c4 n26 v3 c4 l64 v2 c4 c4")
(pattern wind2
    "m2 n28 l24 v3 c4 v4 c4 n25 v5 c4 n23 v6 c4 v5 c4 n27 v4 c4 v3 c4 l64 v2 c4 c4 c4")
(pattern cricket
    "m3 n1 v9 k0 l1 c8 r c8 r c8 r c8 l29 r l1 c8 r c8 r c8 r c8 l29 r l1 c8 r c8 r c8 r c8 l64 r r r l1 c8 r c8 r c8 r c8 l29 r l1 c8 r c8 r c8 r c8 l64 r r r r")
(pattern far
    "m1 v6 k0 l1 a#7 r a#7 r a#7 l37 r l1 a#7 r a#7 r a#7 l64 r r l1 a#7 r a#7 r a#7 l37 r l1 a#7 r a#7 r a#7 l37 r l1 a#7 r a#7 r a#7 l64 r r r")
(pattern in_far "l64 r r l11 r")
(voice 0 wind wind2)
(voice 3 cricket)
(voice 1 in_far loop far)
